5</span>: The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved, by the votes set forth below, an amendment to its Restated Certificate of Incorporation,
as amended (the &#8220;Restated Certificate&#8221;) to effect a reverse stock split (the &#8220;Reverse Stock Split&#8221;) with respect
to the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding common stock, at a ratio of 1-for-10 to 1-for-15 (the &#8220;Range&#8221;), with the ratio
at which the Reverse Stock Split would be effected to be a ratio within the Range to be determined at the discretion of our Board of
Directors.</span></p>

